   Source reviewed at commit 6f5035d (2026-11-09).
   Macro MAC1 format, single-player scheduling model, LittleFS storage model,
   explicit gyro-bias persistence and Bluetooth connection-ownership handling
   are adapted from firmware/src/ds5map.[ch], macro_store.[ch], gyro.[ch] and
   bt_hid_host.c. Our integration keeps the existing Sony/Edge descriptors,
   gyro profiles and configuration protocol. New framing, validation, atomic
   replacement, cancellation rules and web editor are specific to this project.
